erif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">2.2建设地点：</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">银川市西夏区</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 2px; margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 38px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 19px;\">2.3服务期限：</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -5px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 19px;\">自本项目合同签订起，项目立项、设计、招标、</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">施工、监理、造价、安全、质量、进度全过程管控，直至工程竣工验收备案、房屋交付业主、安置入住完成、项目资料移交归档、项</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">目各类审计环节及质保期协调管理全部结束。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 37px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">2.4招标范围：</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">西夏区北部片区城市危旧房改造三期（学怡园）项目</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">-项目管理服务，服务内容包括但不限于：以经批准的施工图预算为投资控制目标；包括实施阶段的设计咨询管理，施工管理(含未完工项目的后续管理工作)、监理管理、工程款支付管理、竣工结算</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">、移交质保、验收后评价，直至发改验收和竣工验收管理、项目各类审计环节等，并对工程项目进行质量、安全、进度、投资、合同</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">、信息、变更等管理和控制，直至办理竣工验收手续和竣工决算等实施过程的建设管理工作；对项目的各类手续报批报建和组织协调各方面推进工作等、整理汇编移交有关项目资料等，具体工作内容</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">详见合同条款约定，以及招标人安排的其他工作</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 38px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">2.5 标段划分：</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">本项目不划分标段</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 38px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">注:说明本次招标项目的建设地点、规模、计划工期/服务期限/交货期限、招标范围、标段划分等。(如果有)</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 2px; margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">3.投标人资格要求</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 2px; margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 37px; text-align: justify; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">3.1本次招标要求投标人需具备独立法人资格，同时具有良好的</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">企业信誉与项目管理相适应的组织机构、管理能力、专业技术与管</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">理人员。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 4px; margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 38px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">3.2拟派项目负责人具有</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">二级及以上注册建造师执业资格或一级</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">注册造价工程师执业资格，同时具有工程类或工程经济类中级及以</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">上专业技术职称，并具有</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">相关项目管理经验。</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">且未担任其他在建工程项目的项目经理。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 37px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">3.3本次招标</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">不接受</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">联合体投标。联合体投标的，应满足下列要</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">求：</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">/</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">4.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 38px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">4.1凡有意参加投标者，请于</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">2026年</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">07</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">月</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">02</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">日0</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">0</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">时</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">00分至2026年</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">07</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">月</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">09</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">日</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">23</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">时</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">59</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">（北京时间，下同），登录“宁夏回族自治区公共资源交易平台 ”（以下简称“ 电子交易平台”）免费下载电子版招标文件。联合体投标的，由联合体牵头人下载招标文件。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 2px; margin-left: 38px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">4.2“</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -6px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">电子交易平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -7px; font-size: 19px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">”实行CA数字证书安全登录管理。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 2px; margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">5.投标文件的递交</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 2px; margin-left: 1px; color: rgb(78, 84, 99); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Rototo, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 38px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 28.5px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 19px;\">5.1本项目投标文件递交的截止时间（投标截止时间，下同）为</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span st